162	<body>
163	<div class="wrap">
164	  <div class="top">
165	    <div class="brand"><i></i>Trueup Witness · #neatHack</div>
166	    <div class="live" id="live">Live · <b id="today">–</b> runs today</div>
167	  </div>
168	
169	  <h1>Your dashboard said <span class="ok">OK</span>.<br>Your agent <span class="bad">crashed</span>.</h1>
170	  <p class="lead">Break a real AI shop bot with one click. Each run is a <b>real Claude call</b> through the model key neatlogs gave every neatHack team, recorded in <b>neatlogs</b>. Trueup Witness watches what really happened and turns on the <b>DISAGREE light</b> when the record is wrong.</p>
171	
172	  <section class="cockpit" id="cockpit">
173	    <div class="grid">
174	      <div>
175	        <div class="card">
176	          <div class="label">The shop bot</div>
177	          <div class="chat" id="chat">
178	            <div class="bubble me">Where's my refund for order 1042?</div>
179	            <div class="bubble bot" id="botMsg">Pick a button below to send it.</div>
180	          </div>
181	          <div class="wire" id="wire" aria-hidden="true">
182	            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 74" preserveAspectRatio="none">
183	              <defs><linearGradient id="flowGrad" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#5cc8ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#9d7bff"/></linearGradient></defs>
184	              <text class="node" x="0" y="14">SHOP BOT</text><text class="node" x="400" y="14" text-anchor="end">CLAUDE</text>
185	              <g class="cableL"><path class="cable" d="M10 44 C 90 44, 130 30, 200 40"/></g>
186	              <g class="cableR"><path class="cable" d="M200 40 C 270 50, 310 44, 390 44"/></g>
187	              <path class="flow" d="M10 44 C 90 44, 130 30, 200 40 C 270 50, 310 44, 390 44"/>
188	              <circle cx="10" cy="44" r="6" fill="#5cc8ff"/><circle cx="390" cy="44" r="6" fill="#9d7bff"/>
189	              <g class="spark" style="transform-origin:200px 40px"><circle cx="200" cy="40" r="10" fill="none" stroke="#ffb547" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="200" cy="40" r="4" fill="#ffb547"/></g>
190	            </svg>
191	          </div>
192	          <div class="btns">
193	            <button class="go" data-break="normal"><span class="ic">💬</span><b>Ask normally</b><small>Nothing breaks</small></button>
194	            <button class="go danger" data-break="cut"><span class="ic">✂️</span><b>Cut the connection</b><small>Mid-reply</small></button>
195	            <button class="go danger" data-break="agent"><span class="ic">💥</span><b>Crash the agent</b><small>The run fails</small></button>
196	          </div>
197	          <div class="switch">
198	            <span class="t">Tracing code:</span>
199	            <div class="toggle" id="toggle" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Tracing code version">
200	              <div class="knob"></div>
201	              <button class="sel" data-mode="released" role="radio" aria-checked="true">As released</button>
202	              <button data-mode="fixed" role="radio" aria-checked="false">With Trueup's fixes</button>
203	            </div>
204	          </div>
205	          <div class="msg" id="msg"></div>
206	        </div>
207	      </div>
208	
209	      <div>
210	        <div class="readouts">
211	          <div class="ro idle" id="roReal"><div class="label">What really happened</div><div class="val" id="realVal">—</div><div class="sub" id="realSub">Waiting for your click</div></div>
212	          <div class="ro idle" id="roRec"><div class="label">What neatlogs recorded</div><div class="val" id="recVal">—</div><div class="sub" id="recSub">Read back from neatlogs</div></div>
213	        </div>
214	        <div class="annun" id="annun">
215	          <div class="lamp" id="lamp">DISAGREE</div>
216	          <div class="why" id="why">The light turns on when the record says the opposite of what really happened.</div>
217	        </div>
218	        <div class="steps" id="steps">
219	          <div class="st" data-s="calling">1 · Real Claude call</div>
220	          <div class="st" data-s="witness">2 · Witness compares</div>
221	          <div class="st" data-s="reading">3 · neatlogs stores it</div>
222	          <div class="st" data-s="done">4 · Record read back</div>
223	        </div>
224	        <div class="card record" id="recCard">
225	          <div class="label">The record in neatlogs, step by step</div>
226	          <div id="recList"><div class="note">Your run's steps appear here, read straight back from neatlogs.</div></div>
227	          <div class="note" id="recLink"></div>
228	        </div>
229	      </div>
230	    </div>
231	  </section>
