258	  <div class="foot reveal">
259	    <b>What this is, plainly.</b> The cut and the crash are real failures we cause on purpose: a small relay drops the connection halfway through a real Claude reply, and the agent asks the real server for a model it refuses. Only these three buttons exist; nothing you type reaches the model. One run at a time, a daily cap. Built for neatHack 2026 with neatlogs, Entire and cfo.ai · <a href="https://github.com/Jennycruzy/trueup">github.com/Jennycruzy/trueup</a><br>Build history recorded with Entire: <a href="https://entire.io/gh/Jennycruzy/trueup/commit/7c92dc427efd873f9351a45364c2f815e942a3cf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">latest recorded commit →</a>
260	  </div>
